# dashboard (`npm run build:pages`), NOT a documentation source tree — so it is
# deliberately NOT ignored. Reference docs live in project-docs/. Once the real
# dashboard deploys from WFRC's own server, docs/ reverts to a docs source tree.
docs/_build/
/site

